OL,3,GNEWSATrojan War fan among 400 conserved
OL,4,Ain archive
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 350-year-old fan depicting a pivotal
OL,7,Fmoment from the Greek legend of the
OL,8,FTrojan War is part of a collection
OL,9,Fbeing cataloged and conserved by
OL,10,Fexperts in Leeds.
OL,12,FDating back to the 1680s, the folding
OL,13,Fhand fan is carved from antique ivory,
OL,14,Fand displays a scene in which the
OL,15,FTrojan prince must choose which goddess
OL,16,F- Hera, Athena, or Aphrodite - is the
OL,17,Fmost beautiful.
OL,19,FThe fan is among 400 items being cared
OL,20,Ffor at Leeds Discovery Centre, with
OL,21,Fseveral currently displayed at an
OL,22,Fexhibition at Lotherton.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
